d degradation of CDO1 in presence of high level of cysteine, but not when cysteine abundance is low (PubMed:40963025)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}